"┌ Toolroll · shop ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── $1.84 today · plan 62% · 2 need you ┐"
"│Needs you 2                         │Live · Steps · Diff · Terminal                                                   │"
"│● Fix the ┌ Keys ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐           │"
"│● Add CSV │j/k          move up and down the list                                                         │           │"
"│          │⏎            open: the changes for a result, else the live output                              │           │"
"│Working 2 │Tab          next tab (Live, Steps, Diff, Terminal)                                            │ild. Press │"
"│◐ Upgrade │s            steer: send the running agent a note                                              │n Toolroll.│"
"│◐ Rate-lim│p            pause the build (again to resume)                                                 │           │"
"│          │x            stop the build                                                                    │           │"
"│Done today│1-9          answer the agent's question                                                       │           │"
"│✓ Bump dep│a            accept the result                                                                 │           │"
"│          │r            send the result back, with a note                                                 │           │"
"│          │t            take over: type in a terminal on the latest build (Ctrl-] back)                   │           │"
"│          │n            new task (Enter: Just code, Tab: plan first)                                      │           │"
"│          │!            next thing that needs you, oldest first                                           │           │"
"│          │L/o          split the screen; next panel                                                      │           │"
"│          │PgUp/PgDn    scroll; End follows the newest                                                    │           │"
"│          │w            open Toolroll in your browser                                                     │           │"
"│          │q            quit                                                                              │           │"
"│          │                                                                                               │           │"
"│          │In Diff: j/k a line  [/] a hunk  {/} a file  c a note  e/E more lines  v side by side  y copy  │           │"
"│          │In Terminal: t types in it  PgUp/PgDn scroll back  y copy                                      │           │"
"│          │                                                                                               │           │"
"│          │:            every action, task, project and setting                                           │           │"
"│          │Keys: the default preset; change them in tui.toml under [keys].                                │           │"
"│          │Mouse: click to select, wheel to scroll, drag the divider.                                     │           │"
"│          │Press s for settings, any other key to close.                                                  │           │"
"│          └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘           │"
